ve one last opportunity to influence an uncertain outcome. What guides your next step?","category":"determinant","options":[{"id":"1f5147b55e13","text":"Let them repeat it while preparing a measured response.","weights":[2,2,1,4,2,2,1,1]},{"id":"9cfa438878b8","text":"Give both sides breathing room and help the quieter person recover confidence.","weights":[0,2,1,3,1,4,1,0]},{"id":"d554dca0160a","text":"Make one small commitment, observe its cost, and reconsider before extending it.","weights":[1,2,1,3,1,3,1,0]}],"pair":["guardian","healer"]},{"version":2,"id":"v2-det-guardian-healer-1","prompt":"Your earlier approach is understood now. What comes naturally as you make your next commitment?","category":"determinant","options":[{"id":"102af9e3400e","text":"Let them repeat it while preparing a measured response.","weights":[2,2,1,4,2,2,1,1]},{"id":"91b48caccf2d","text":"Give both sides breathing room and help the quieter person recover confidence.","weights":[0,2,1,3,1,4,1,0]},{"id":"5995fae41d35","text":"Make one small commitment, observe its cost, and reconsider before extending it.","weights":[1,2,1,3,1,3,1,0]}],"pair":["guardian","healer"]},{"version":2,"id":"v2-det-guardian-ninja-0","prompt":"You have one last opportunity to influence an uncertain outcome. What guides your next step?","category":"determinant","options":[{"id":"e2aaf383bf8f","text":"Let them repeat it while preparing a measured response.","weights":[2,2,1,4,2,2,1,1]},{"id":"e5a217dc701e","text":"Change your rhythm immediately and see how they adjust.","weights":[2,2,4,1,2,1,1,1]},{"id":"fcae6bcfd4ba","text":"Make one small commitment, observe its cost, and reconsider before extending it.","weights":[2,2,2,2,2,1,1,1]}],"pair":["guardian","ninja"]},{"version":2,"id":"v2-det-guardian-ninja-1","prompt":"Your earlier approach is understood now. What comes naturally as you make your next commitment?","category":"determinant","options":[{"id":"4d25547dd8d7","text":"Let them repeat it while preparing a mea